{
  "_readme": [
    "Documented historical flood events, used as ground truth to calibrate and",
    "validate basin thresholds. This file is the evidence base for every alert",
    "level Tayari issues — scripts/calibrate_basins.py derives thresholds from it",
    "and scripts/validate_thresholds.py re-checks them.",
    "",
    "To add a basin you MUST add events for it here first. A basin with no",
    "documented events cannot be threshold-calibrated, and the calibration script",
    "will refuse to emit alert levels for it rather than invent numbers.",
    "",
    "Windows are deliberately generous (a few weeks) because displacement",
    "reporting lags the hydrograph peak. Each event needs a source."
  ],
